            "review_text": "UyenMinhLe\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n1\nSichuan vegetarian hotpot in Saigon with friendly-eco service\nMar 2020 • Couples\nIf you are looking for a Sichuan hotpot in vegetarian way, there is no doubt to visit this gem place to experience the tasty veggie brooth. Additionally, I am pleased with the way they care for the environment by using resuable straws and normal tissues instead the wet ones. \n\nI definitely come back here for Sichuan veggie hotpot.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 8, 2020",
