            "review_text": "Ontheroadsincethen\n1 contribution\n1\nVery Tasty! Great place !\nNov 2018 • Friends\nI keep coming back to this place ! \n\nHotpot soup is very tasty I would say up there with the best - soups are packed with flavour and not too oily , you can ask for your level of spiciness for the Sichuan . Dishes are all hand made , with excellent flavour and many options\n\nRestaurant itself has a very nice decor and a cosy feel .\n\nStaff are very attentive and helpful \n\nI would recommend this place to anyone,\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 27, 2019",
