            "review_text": "miaivylee\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\nDisappointed\nJun 2017 • Friends\nI came with my friend, we are two persons. We order 01 Kakhu tofu and 01 Hot-pot including relating items with hot pot such as meat, mushroom, vegetable..The taste if hot pot is not XiChuan hot pot, I just feel spicy only. However, the sauce is good.\nThe total cost is 1.1 millions VND, but the quality is not correspondence with the cost. I think the host should reconsider the selling price again or improve the quality. \nWith same cost, I could enjoy at the luxury Chinese restaurant as well. \nI will never come back again. Sorry\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 13, 2017",
