            "review_text": "Skylar\nVancouver, Washington3 contributions\n0\nAmazing!\nApr 2017 • Couples\nThe environment was amazing. A relief from the heat with this air conditioned gem. The employees were fantastic and always willing and wanting to provide excellent service. The restaurant is on the second floor so you have to keep your eye out. When you walk into this restaurant you are blown away by the beautiful layout and cleanliness of this place. They offer extremely fresh ingredients and a variety of delicious meats that you get to cook to your taste. They have a relaxing low volume music playing to ease the sounds of the busy streets. They have a variety of beverages non-alcoholic and alcoholic . Best place I have ate to this point in my trip and I am so glad we found it!\nRead more\nWritten April 19, 2017",
